> [!abstract] Every continuous oral (supplements + daily meds) **grouped by when it runs out**, with the restock-by date, the cash to prep, and how much to buy to last to **end-2027** or **end-2028**. Cycle PEDs and injectable peptides are excluded — they live in [[Cycle PED Restock — Decision & Buy Plan]]. Stock from each note's `stock_on_hand`; burn = `dose × days/week ÷ 7`.

> [!tip] How to use this: each group has ONE shop trip. Order **~2–4 weeks before the earliest run-out** in the group so a single basket (iHerb RM450 free-ship threshold) covers the whole cluster. Buy the **→2028** column if you want to front-load and shop less often; **→2027** if you'd rather keep cash free and re-buy next year.

