## Assumptions
- Burn rate uses current `daily_dose` × frequency; **buy quantities round up to whole boxes**.
- "Restock by" = ~2–4 weeks before the earliest item in the group runs out (lets one basket cover the cluster).
- Oral Minoxidil costed at the Lazada box price (RM261.30) — switch source to drop it.
- Excludes cycle PEDs, injectables, peptides (→ [[Cycle PED Restock — Decision & Buy Plan]]) and as-needed/situational items.

